---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OrganizationSchema from '../components/seo/OrganizationSchema.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Yukun — Product Matching & Supply Coordination" description="Yukun supports product matching and supply coordination for compact motion applications.">
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">About Yukun</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mb-12">
        Independent product matching and supply coordination for compact motion applications.
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none
        [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-4
        [&_h3]:text-xl [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:mt-8 [&_h3]:mb-3
        [&_p]:text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] [&_p]:leading-relaxed
      ">
        <h2>Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          Yukun helps product teams identify and coordinate compact motion components, including
          gear motors, brushless motors, micro pumps, and position switches. We translate application
          requirements into a practical product-matching and inquiry process.
        </p>
        <p>
          The website is a capability display and inquiry channel. Product pages explain categories
          and selection considerations; final specifications and supply details are reviewed for each
          application.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 my-8">
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] border border-[var(--color-border-default)] rounded-xl p-5">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎯</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2">Solution-First</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">We start with your application, not a parts list. The right motor for a smart lock is different from the right motor for a surgical robot — even if they share the same diameter.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] border border-[var(--color-border-default)] rounded-xl p-5">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">⚡</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2">Inquiry-Led</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">We confirm the application, interfaces, documentation needs, and evaluation criteria before coordinating a product option.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] border border-[var(--color-border-default)] rounded-xl p-5">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🔧</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2">Configuration Review</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Shaft, feedback, connector, mounting, winding, and packaging needs can be discussed as part of model matching.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>How We Work</h2>
        <p>Each inquiry is coordinated around the information needed for an informed evaluation:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Application, load, motion, envelope, and duty-cycle review</li>
          <li>Electrical, mechanical, and control-interface discussion</li>
          <li>Available drawings and technical documents</li>
          <li>Model-specific test and compliance requirements</li>
          <li>Evaluation feedback and follow-up coordination</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Supply Coordination</h2>
        <p>
          We support international inquiries from Shenzhen. Product specifications, availability,
          lead time, and commercial terms are confirmed for each inquiry.
        </p>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:chinajpq@outlook.com">chinajpq@outlook.com</a> to discuss your application.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Structured Data -->
  <OrganizationSchema slot="structured-data" />
</BaseLayout>
